  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">JORDAN YOUNG SCIENTIST PROGRAMME 2024</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Support for the preparation and organization of the 2024 JoYS Exhibition. This funding supports the payment of salaries for the JOYS Coordinator and Assistant, as well as core funding for the work carried out by the JoYS team with teachers and students around the country in the run-up to the JoYS Exhibition in June, as well as costs in the execution of the summit itself. Later tranches support the follow-up work of JoYS in Q3 and Q4, with students, partners and others, after successful completion of the Exhibition. Tranche Two.</narrative>
  </description>
